{
  "$comment": "NU-055 name-alignment fixtures: the search-as-you-type net and its buggy variant. Same row schema as spec/verification-fixtures/nu-relay-fixtures.json: each net is given inline as `rows`: [transition, [inputs], [outputs], [match keys], [relay targets]], every input consumed once and every output produced once, every place holding String tokens whose value is their own name, read by every match-key and relay projection: that is the one-projection premise of the Lean model (`Exec.ProjCoherent`, [NU-050]). `marking` is the initial marking (coloured places start empty, except in the `unknown` fixtures that mark one or two to test that refusal; the three-keystrokes fixture marks `typed` with 3); `carrierPlaces`, `fragmentMode` and `mintTransitions` configure the verifier as their names say (`mintTransitions` as in spec/verification-fixtures/fixtures.json, [NU-010]). Every fixture carries `route: \"B\"`: a runner MUST assert that the report names Route B before comparing the verdict, except for an `unknown` fixture, where it MUST assert that the reason contains `reasonContains`: the quoted place, or `EXTENDED` for the declined fragment, that the refusal order of [NU-055] picks when several refusals apply. `budgetPlaces`, where present, declares budget places ([NU-040]); a name-alignment property still goes to Route B ([NU-055]). `environmentPlaces` and `environmentMode` (`always-available`), where present, register those places as environment places under that [VER-006] mode; they are absent from `marking` ([NU-055] AC6). Route B is solver-free, so there are no script goldens. Property types: `name-aligned` and `quiescent-name-aligned` take `places`, the non-empty list `S` ([NU-055]); `quiescent-count` takes `places`, `min`, `max` ([VER-002]). `expected` is `proven`, `violated` or `unknown`. `witnessLength`, where present, is the number of firings in the shortest counterexample, which Route B reports ([VER-012] AC3), counted as Route B firings, not as executor start and complete events; the firing order within it is not pinned.",
